From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dubzer <me@dubzer.dev>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 18:17:25 +0300
Subject: Load full-size attachment photos only when zooming or editing

Use smaller photo previews when choosing attachments to reduce decoding,
resizing and texture-upload work. Request the normal full-size viewer
image when the user zooms in or starts editing, keeping the preview visible
until it is ready and deferring editing until loading completes.

Preserve zoom through asynchronous image replacement, retain already
edited bitmaps, and clear preview state when the photo changes or the
viewer closes or is destroyed.
---
